{"id":"n48918-1-9","stage":5,"title":"독신 · 单身","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48918-1-9-1","ko":"독신으로 사는 건 어때요? 외롭지 않아요?","zh":"单身生活怎么样？不会孤单吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"독신으로","meaning":"单身","explanation":"독신：单身；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"독신","audio":"/audio/5402c6ba8d18e0b09704.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48918","senseId":"1","lemma":"독신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사는","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외롭지","meaning":"孤单，孤独","explanation":"외롭다：孤单，孤独；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"외롭다","audio":"/audio/ef5d5d3c43b8eb4126a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67854","senseId":"1","lemma":"외롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않아요?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5402c6ba8d18e0b0","term":"독신","zh":"单身","audio":"/audio/5402c6ba8d18e0b09704.mp3","entryId":"48918","definition":"没有配偶自己一个人生活；或指那种人。","pronunciation":["독씬"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"ef5d5d3c43b8eb41","term":"외롭다","zh":"孤单，孤独","audio":"/audio/ef5d5d3c43b8eb4126a9.mp3","entryId":"67854","definition":"独自一人或没有可依靠的地方，孤寂落寞。","pronunciation":["외롭따","웨롭따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/29fb87a64e91a67bcd30.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48918-1-9-2","ko":"아니요. 저는 이렇게 혼자 사는 게 편해요.","zh":"不会啊。我这样一个人生活反而更自在。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사는","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편해요.","meaning":"舒服，舒畅","explanation":"편하다：舒服，舒畅；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"1","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自，单独","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30207","definition":"只有一人，没有别人。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"33bf1e37d2739b22","term":"편하다","zh":"舒服，舒畅","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3","entryId":"71334","definition":"身体或心情不难受，好。","pronunciation":["편하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/96be8510a4ab0f941df0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.165,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=48918","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习